WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.153
India is a founding member

2
00:00:02.153 --> 00:00:03.235
of the UN.

3
00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:04.697
But not a permanent member

4
00:00:04.697 --> 00:00:06.553
of the Security Council.

5
00:00:06.886 --> 00:00:08.727
India has been elected a

6
00:00:08.727 --> 00:00:11.076
non-permanent member 8 times.

7
00:00:11.076 --> 00:00:14.269
Most recently for 2021 to

8
00:00:14.269 --> 00:00:15.436
2022.

9
00:00:15.786 --> 00:00:17.512
India has long been among

10
00:00:17.512 --> 00:00:19.541
the largest contributors to UN

11
00:00:19.541 --> 00:00:23.377
peacekeeping, since the 1950s.

12
00:00:23.736 --> 00:00:24.749
With Brazil,

13
00:00:24.749 --> 00:00:26.187
Germany and Japan,

14
00:00:26.187 --> 00:00:28.063
India forms the G4,

15
00:00:28.063 --> 00:00:30.859
pushing for Security Council reform.

16
00:00:31.194 --> 00:00:32.371
Your turn.

17
00:00:32.371 --> 00:00:33.990
Who's the fourth?
